<title>USA: Allstate unit prices capital securities.</title>
<headline>Allstate unit prices capital securities.</headline>
<dateline>NORTHBROOK, Ill. 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Allstate Corp said Allstate Financing Trust II, a subsidiary trust of Allstate, has priced $200 million of capital securities at $1,000 per security.</p>
<p>Holders of the securities will be entitled to receive cash distributions at an annual percentage rate of 7.83 percent. The securities mature on December 1, 2045.</p>
<p>Allstate Corp is parent of Allstate Insurance Co.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
